	e pours and explanations take place between acts — a seamless evening of l
	aughs and libations. \nThis is the ultimate way to discover new favorite w
	ines while enjoying the vibrant NYC comedy scene. Get a babysitter and tre
	at yourself to a night out unlike any other. \nEvent Details\nDate: August
