	 York\, NY 10003City: New York\, NYPrice: $30.00 General AdmissionNote: Ex
	clusive 10% discount on featured wine and spirits available \nAbout the Ve
	nue\nSome Good Wine is a boutique wine shop and event space located at 13 
	E 8th Street in Greenwich Village\, New York City. Known for its curated s
	election of global wines and intimate atmosphere\, it’s the perfect settin
	g for an evening that combines comedy and wine culture in equal measure. \
	nWhat to Expect\nEnjoy five stand-up comedy sets from some of New York Cit
	y’s hottest comics\, with expert wine pours and explanations woven seamles
	sly between each performance. The format ensures a relaxed\, entertaining 
	pace — you’ll laugh\, learn about wine\, and discover new favorites all in
	 one evening. \nAn exclusive 10% discount on featured wine and spirits is 
	available for attendees\, making this a great opportunity to take home a b
	ottle from the show. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available through F
