SUMMARY:Lance Woods LIVE at Punch Line Philly
DTSTAMP:20260824T033957Z
DTSTART:20260827T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLance Woo
	ds is a standout comedian known for his sharp\, observational humor and hi
	s ability to find comedy in the everyday moments of life. With a style tha
	t is both relatable and refreshingly honest\, Woods has built a loyal foll
	owing of fans who appreciate his authentic\, no-frills approach to stand-u
	p comedy. \nWoods has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the c
	ountry\, earning a reputation as a consistently funny and engaging live pe
	rformer. His material covers a wide range of topics — from relationships a
	nd family dynamics to social observations and personal experiences — all d
	elivered with the kind of timing and confidence that comes from years of h
	oning his craft on stage. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or catching him 
	for the first time\, Lance Woods delivers the kind of stand-up set that re
	minds you why live comedy is one of the best nights out you can have. His 
	Philadelphia stop at Punch Line Philly is shaping up to be a must-see show
	 of the summer. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026 \nTime:
	 7:30 PM EDT \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelph
	ia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restriction: 21+ with 2-beverage minimum \nTicket Pric
	es: Starting from $25 (plus fees) \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Philly is 
	Philadelphia’s go-to destination for world-class stand-up comedy\, situate
	d at 33 E. Laurel Street in the heart of the Northern Liberties neighborho
	od. The club accommodates approximately 300 guests in an intimate\, table-
	seating layout that puts every audience member close to the action. \nThe 
	venue features a full-service bar\, attentive staff\, and a warm\, energet
	ic atmosphere that makes every show feel like a special occasion. The acou
	stics and sight lines are excellent throughout the room\, ensuring a premi
	um experience no matter where you’re seated. \nPunch Line Philly is conven
	iently located near public transit options and has parking available in ne
	arby lots and garages. Doors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showt
	ime — arrive early to get the best seats and enjoy a drink before the show
	 kicks off. \nWhat to Expect\nLance Woods brings a grounded\, authentic en
	ergy to the stage that immediately connects with audiences. His set is a w
	ell-crafted mix of sharp one-liners\, longer storytelling bits\, and crowd
	-pleasing observations that build to big laughs throughout the evening. \n
	The show will feature an opening act followed by Lance Woods’s full headli
	ning performance. It’s the perfect mid-week comedy night — a chance to unw
	ind\, laugh hard\, and enjoy a great show in one of Philly’s best intimate
	 venues. \nThis is a 21+ event with a two-beverage minimum. Tickets are av
	ailable now — don’t sleep on this one\, as Punch Line Philly shows regular
	ly sell out. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $55 (plus fees) \nTi
	ckets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale
	). Book your seats today! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post con
	tains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n
	\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/lance-woods-live-at-punch-line-philly/\
	n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
