DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nGabriel Fluffy Iglesias LIVE at Ilani Cowlitz Ball
	room\nOne of the most beloved stand-up comedians in the world\, Gabriel “F
	luffy” Iglesias\, is bringing his legendary live show to the Ilani Cowlitz
	 Ballroom in Ridgefield\, Washington on August 27\, 2026. Known for his in
	fectious energy\, hilarious storytelling\, and iconic sound effects\, Fluf
	fy delivers a show that leaves audiences in tears of laughter. \nEvent Det
	ails\nDate: Thursday\, August 27\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Ilani Cowli
	tz Ballroom\nAddress: 1 Cowlitz Way\, Ridgefield\, WA 98642\nAge Requireme
	nt: All Ages \nAbout Gabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias\nGabriel Iglesias\, affecti
	onately known as “Fluffy\,” is one of America’s most successful stand-up c
	omedians and actors. He has sold out arenas worldwide\, released multiple 
	hit Netflix specials including “Stadium Fluffy\,” and starred in the hit T
	V series Mr. Iglesias. His comedy blends personal stories\, cultural obser
	vations\, and masterful character voices that connect with audiences of al
	l backgrounds. With over 20 million social media followers\, Fluffy is a t
	rue comedy phenomenon. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class stand-up comedy fro
	m one of the biggest names in the business\nHilarious stories about family
	\, food\, culture\, and everyday life\nGabriel’s signature sound effects a
	nd character voices\nHigh-energy performance that keeps the laughs coming 
	all night\nA premium casino ballroom experience at ilani Resort\nAn unforg
	ettable night of feel-good\, inclusive comedy\n\nVenue Information\nThe Il
	ani Cowlitz Ballroom is a premier entertainment venue located at the ilani
	 Casino Resort in Ridgefield\, Washington\, just north of Portland. The ve
	nue offers excellent sightlines\, top-notch sound\, and a full-service cas
	ino resort experience with dining and accommodations on-site. \nTicket Inf
	ormation\nTickets start at $120. Available through official Ticketmaster c
	hannels and resale marketplaces. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis
	 post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase ticke
	ts through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show t
	imes subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps
