SUMMARY:Francisco Ramos LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DTSTAMP:20260824T033957Z
DTSTART:20260828T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nFrancisco Ramos is a bilingual stand-up comedian who has been making 
	audiences laugh across the United States with his unique blend of English 
	and Spanish comedy. Known for his high-energy performances and sharp cultu
	ral observations\, Ramos has built a devoted following among Latino audien
	ces and comedy fans of all backgrounds. \nHis comedy draws from his experi
	ences growing up in a Latino household\, navigating two cultures\, and the
	 universal absurdities of family life. Francisco has a natural charisma on
	 stage that makes his shows feel like a party — energetic\, inclusive\, an
	d genuinely funny. \nHe has performed at top venues including the Arlingto
	n Drafthouse\, Desert Ridge Improv in Phoenix\, and now brings his show to
	 Punch Line Houston for a weekend run. His Thursday Spanish-language show 
	(En Español) on August 27 and his Friday/Saturday English shows on August 
	28-29 offer something for everyone. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, Augu
	st 28\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Hou
	ston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction:
	 18+ (2 Beverage Minimum per person)\nTicket Prices: $38 – $50 (fees inclu
	ded)\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Houston is the premier comedy club in 
	downtown Houston\, located at 1204 Caroline Street. This Live Nation-opera
	ted venue is the city’s top destination for national stand-up comedy acts\
	, offering an intimate setting that brings you up close to the performers.
	 \nThe club features a general admission floor with preferred seating upgr
	ades available. The full bar and 2-beverage minimum per person create a fu
	n\, social atmosphere that enhances the comedy experience. Every seat in t
	he house offers a great view of the stage. \nParking is available via vale
	t service (at most shows) or the Green Street garage on Clay between Main 
	and Fannin\, which connects to the venue via skybridge. The club is cashle
	ss — all major credit and debit cards are accepted. \nWhat to Expect\nFran
	cisco Ramos delivers a high-energy\, crowd-pleasing performance that blend
	s sharp observational humor with cultural storytelling. His Friday night s
	how is the perfect way to close out August with a night of genuine laughs.
	 \nDoors open at 6:00 PM\, so arrive early to grab your seats and get your
	 first round in before the show starts at 7:00 PM. A late show at 9:15 PM 
	is also available on Saturday August 29. The performance runs approximatel
	y 90 minutes. \nNote: A special Spanish-language show (En Español) is also
	 available on Thursday August 27 at 7:30 PM for Spanish-speaking audiences
	. All shows are 18+ with a 2-beverage minimum. No cell phones or recording
	 permitted during the performance. \nTicket Information\nTickets are price
	d from $38 to $50 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). Purchase 
	official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale options on VividSeats
	. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. W
	e may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar
	.com/event/francisco-ramos-live-at-punch-line-houston/\n\nFrom Comedy Cale
	ndar
